525 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Why exactly is health insurance so important? Because it is required by  law and without it you will not get an Aufenthaltstitel \(residence permit\) in Germany. However, it can be a bit tricky because as an international in Germany you might not have access to statutory health insurance straight away. This  can be the case, for example, if you arrive in Germany before the official start of your studies or if you first  attend a preparatory language course \(Studienkolleg\).)
/E (Why exactly is health insurance so important? Because it is required by  law and without it you will not get an Aufenthaltstitel \(residence permit\) in Germany. However, it can be a bit tricky because as an international in Germany you might not have access to statutory health insurance straight away. This  can be the case, for example, if you arrive in Germany before the official start of your studies or if you first  attend a preparatory language course \(Studienkolleg\).)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
